n what subpages the visitor enters – this information is used to optimize the visitor's experience. Maximal lagringstid : 1000 dagar Typ : HTTP-cookie heat.aspx Collects data on the user’s navigation and behavior on the website. This is used to compile statistical reports and heatmaps for the website owner. Maximal lagringstid : Session Typ : Pixelspårare image.aspx Registers statistical data on users' behaviour on the website. Used for internal analytics by the website operator. Maximal lagringstid : Session Typ : Pixelspårare Unibuddy 7 Läs mer om den här leverantören invite_id Used by third-party student enrollment service. Maximal lagringstid : Beständig Typ : Lokal HTML-lagring ld:#:$diagnostics Used to monitor website performance for statistical purposes. Maximal lagringstid : Beständig Typ : Lokal HTML-lagring sentryReplaySession Registers data on visitors' website-behaviour. This is used for internal analysis and website optimization. Maximal lagringstid : Session Typ : Lokal HTML-lagring ub_campaign Registers statistical data on users' behaviour on the website. Used for internal analytics by the website operator. Maximal lagringstid : Beständig Typ : Lokal HTML-lagring ub_content Registers statistical data on users' behaviour on the website. Used for internal analytics by the website operator. Maximal lagringstid : Beständig Typ : Lokal HTML-lagring ub_medium Registers statistical data on users' behaviour on the website. Used for internal analytics by the website operator. Maximal lagringstid : Beständig Typ : Lokal HTML-lagring ub_source Registers statistical data on users' behaviour on the website. Used for internal analytics by the website operator. Maximal lagringstid : Beständig Typ : Lokal HTML-lagring Extern media 2 Cookies för extern media används av webbplatser som ex YouTube att spåra besökare. Avsikten är att visa annonser som är relevanta och engagerande för enskilda användare, och därmed mer värdefull för utgivare och tredjepartsannonsörer. Unibuddy 2 Läs mer om den här leverantören __mpq_#_# Collects data on user behaviour and interaction in order to optimize the website and make advertisement on the website more relevant. Maximal lagringstid : Beständig Typ : Lokal HTML-lagring mp_#_mixpanel Väntande Maximal lagringstid : 1 år Typ : HTTP-cookie Oklassificerade 2 Oklassificerade cookies är cookies som håller på att klassificeras tillsammans med utfärdarna av enskilda cookies. Ontame.io 2 Läs mer om den här leverantören ontame_id.778d Väntande Maximal lagringstid : 1 år Typ : HTTP-cookie ontame_ses.778d Väntande Maximal lagringstid : 1 dag Typ : HTTP-cookie Domänöverskridande godkännande [#BULK_CONSENT_DOMAINS_COUNT#] [#BULK_CONSENT_TITLE#] Lista över domäner som du ger samtycke till: [#BULK_CONSENT_DOMAINS#] Cookie-deklaration uppdaterades senast 8/4/26 av Cookiebot [#IABV2_TITLE#] [#IABV2_BODY_INTRO#] [#IABV2_BODY_LEGITIMATE_INTEREST_INTRO#] [#IABV2_BODY_PREFERENCE_INTRO#] [#IABV2_LABEL_PURPOSES#] [#IABV2_BODY_PURPOSES_INTRO#] [#IABV2_BODY_PURPOSES#] [#IABV2_LABEL_FEATURES#] [#IABV2_BODY_FEATURES_INTRO#] [#IABV2_BODY_FEATURES#] [#IABV2_LABEL_PARTNERS#] [#IABV2_BODY_PARTNERS_INTRO#] [#IABV2_BODY_PARTNERS#] Om Cookies är små textfiler som kan användas av webbplatser för att göra en användares upplevelse mer effektiv. Lagen säger att vi får lagra cookies på din enhet om de är absolut nödvändiga för att kunna använda den här webbplatsen. För alla andra ändamål krävs ditt medgivande. Denna webbplats använder olika typer av cookies. Vissa cookies placeras ut av tredjepartstjänster som visas på våra sidor. Du kan ändra eller dra tillbaka ditt samtycke till cookie-förklaringen på vår webbplats. Läs mer i vår sekretesspolicy om vilka vi är, hur du kontaktar oss och på vilket sätt vi behandlar personuppgifter. Ange ditt samtyckes-ID och datum för när du kontaktade oss gällande ditt samtycke. Sälj eller dela inte mina personuppgifter Avvisa Tillåt urval Anpassa Tillåt alla Go to content Login Intranet ( Opens in new tab ) Library ( Opens in new tab ) Svenska sv Search Menu Education Research Collaborate with us About Chalmers Current Departments Assistant professor positions Home About Chalmers Work with us Assistant professor positions Materials Science Available position: Assistant Professor in Materials Science Image 1 of 1 Chalmers now seeks curious and creative individuals for tenure-track Assistant Professors. As an Assistant Professor in Materials Science at Chalmers, you can turn your scientific curiosity into ideas, your ideas into experiments, and your experiments into discoveries. Application closed The application for the seventh global recruitment round for Assistant Professors is now closed. Advancing materials science for a sustainable future Materials science at Chalmers combines fundamental research with applications that address major societal challenges. Our research spans the entire materials value chain, from theory and modelling to synthesis, characterisation and evaluation of material properties. We focus on materials for energy applications, materials for health applications, and materials for green transitions. Through interdisciplinary collaboration and strong links to industry, we develop advanced materials that enable sustainable technologies and future innovations. The position is a five-year tenure-track appointment with a competitive start-up package including funding for personnel, equipment, and operational costs.You will also get relocation support, mentoring, and leadership training to support your development as an independent research leader and educator. The research spans several departments, including but not limited to: Architecture and Civil Engineering Chemistry and Chemical Engineering Life Sciences Mechanical Engineering Microtechnology and Nanoscience Physics and Astronomy Linked research infrastructures and centres ARTEMI Chalmers Materials Analysis Laboratory (CMAL) MAX IV Nanofabrication Laboratory (Myfab) National Academic Infrastructure for Super­computing in Sweden (NAISS) The Swedish NMR Centre Wallenberg Initiative Materials Science for Sustainability (WISE) Wallenberg Wood Science Center (WWSC) Learn more about the offer Brief timeline, available positions and more information about the offer For questions about the process, please contact Recruitment systems support HR department, Chalmers operations support Contact rekr.stodet@chalmers.se For questions about the position, please contact To personal page Leif Asp Full Professor , Computational Mechanics and Materials Engineering, Mechanical Engineering Contact leif.asp@chalmers.se +46 31 772 15 43 To personal page Updated 2 June 2026, 13:43 Published 12 December 2023, 17:10 Assistant professor positions Basic Science Batteries Energy Materials Science Mechanical Engineering Nanoscience New Space Production Transport Related content Reputation and ranking Our vision: World in progress Research infrastructures Research areas Departments For questions about the process, please contact Recruitment systems support HR department, Chalmers operations support Contact rekr.stodet@chalmers.se For questions about the position, please contact To personal page Leif Asp Full Professor , Computational Mechanics and Materials Engineering, Mechanical Engineering Contact leif.asp@chalmers.se +46 31 772 15 43 To personal page Contact Chalmers Phone +46-317721000 Mail address Chalmers University of Technology 412 96 Gothenburg E-mail and more contact information Organisation number 556479-5598 Education Education Your studies Our Master's degree programmes Student support Services and tools Canvas learning management system Safe at Chalmers Chalmers student union Shortcuts Shortcuts Work at Chalmers Press and media Whistleblowing at Chalmers Safety and emergency situations Supplier information Chalmers University of Technology Foundation About the website About the website Cookies Processing of personal data Accessibility statement Service Disruptions at Chalmers Contact Chalmers Phone +46-317721000 Mail address Chalmers University of Technology 412 96 Gothenburg E-mail and more contact information Organisation number 556479-5598 Social media Instagram ( Opens in new tab ) Tiktok ( Opens in new tab ) Youtube ( Opens in new tab ) LinkedIn ( Opens in new tab ) Facebook ( Opens in new tab ) With scientific excellence as a basis, Chalmers conducts research and education in technology, natural sciences, maritime studies and architecture. Social media Instagram ( Opens in new tab ) Tiktok ( Opens in new tab ) Youtube ( Opens in new tab ) LinkedIn ( Opens in new tab ) Facebook ( Opens in new tab )"
